        <mxCell id="boundary" value="Missing source authority stops protected calls. A notification or query result cannot prove file capture or complete source coverage.&#10;Covered progress needs durable item outcomes; mapping and product receipt may finish later. Unsafe files retain an approved controlled-access path.&#10;The saved-file read starts with an authorised request and does not refetch externally. Buyer acceptance and payment reporting belong to SPEC-SEI-009." style="text;html=0;align=left;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="28" y="1060" width="2614" height="96" />
        </mxCell>
